  "details": "VRChat has countless wonderful worlds with spawn points set to very unappealing locations. Dark boring entranceways, paths far away from all the pretty vistas and hangout spots, facing ugly menus, etc. This makes many worlds that are intended to be home worlds quite bad at being home worlds since you load into a terrible location every time.\n\nLet VRC+ subscribers set their own spawn point for their home world and many thousands of worlds would suddenly become fantastic home worlds and much better hangout spaces.\n\nWorld creators should be able to disable this for their worlds in the \"Default Content Settings\" section like they can for drones, items, etc. as the feature could break/exploit games and other content that requires players to hit triggers to progress.",
